## 10. Recommended settings for frontend development

Open Settings (`Ctrl + ,`) or edit `settings.json`.

JSON

```
{
    "editor.fontSize": 14,
    "editor.tabSize": 2,
    "editor.insertSpaces": true,
    "editor.wordWrap": "on",
    "editor.formatOnSave": true,
    "editor.minimap.enabled": false,
    "files.autoSave": "afterDelay",
    "emmet.triggerExpansionOnTab": true,
    "editor.bracketPairColorization.enabled": true
}
```

For a project using Prettier, you can set it as the default formatter for each language:

JSON

```
{
    "[html]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
    },
    "[css]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
    },
    "[javascript]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
    },
    "[typescript]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
    }
}
```

